  "Description": {
    "Cost": 5732170,
    "UIName": "Emperor",
    "Id": "chassisdef_emperor_EMP-GSR-EC",
    "Name": "Emperor",
    "Details": "The original <i>Emperor</i> GSR was something of an oddity. The SLDF Gunslinger program was typically focused around duels, and the <i>Emperor</i> GSR was a Command 'Mech. This oddity apparently slipped under the radar, even to the Clans, who continued to overlook the obvious Command Console in favour of bringing the laser weapons up to spec. In addition, the machine guns were removed to reintegrate the classic trio of jump jets commonly seen on <i>Emperors.</i>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Cooling Jacket - Laser</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.24</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_emperor"
  },
