  "YangsThoughts": "I'm no stranger to the Emperor's reputation to keep lasers running cool, but this is an <i>incredibly</i> ambitious build, even with the improvements to the cooling jackets. That said, I think with some restraint, I could see this thing doing some serious work as direct fire support.",
